abstract: >
  Stage-wise reconstruction of the World Bank SPI v4.0 index from the indicator-level file
  (73 fields, 240,900 cells, 0 mismatches at tolerance 1e-9), quantification of revisions across
  releases v1.0-v4.0, and a status-coded register of 251 numerical claims from a national report
  on Uzbekistan. Inputs are pinned to commit 2dd02f746cb4e2159281adc74d6865f948e90ce1 and SHA-256 verified.
